    description: "The 810 is the only treadmill on this page whose listing names user profiles, and that is its case for a couple. The Amazon listing gives a blue backlit LCD with 16 workout programs and two user profiles, a 10% motorized incline, speeds up to 10 mph, a 20 by 55-inch running path with SoftTrak cushioning, heart rate contact grips, a USB charging port and SoftDrop folding with wheels. The maximum user weight is 275 lb, and the warranty is 10 years on the motor and frame, one year on mechanical and electrical parts and one year of labour. An optional Explore the World subscription adds route workouts that adjust to your speed, but the profiles and programs work without it. The limits are those of its price. A 275 lb rating with a sensible margin suits users up to about 225 lb, the 55-inch deck suits walking and easy jogging better than running for a tall partner, and 10 mph is enough for most joggers but not for fast intervals. For two walkers of moderate size who want separate records without a subscription, it is hard to beat. Amazon showed it at $584.30 on 24 November 2026.",
  },
  {
    id: "bowflex-t16",
    name: "BowFlex T16",
    brand: "BowFlex",
    category: "Highest weight limit for two people",
    badge: "Highest Capacity",
    amazonUrl: "https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0GSBKBRD8?tag=sktiger-20&linkCode=ll1",
    amazonLabel: "Check Price on Amazon",
    image: {"url":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31I8-29nvEL._SL500_.jpg","width":500,"height":500},
